rl":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/73022","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73022","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73022.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73022.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nA Dag run triggered with a large conf makes scheduler memory scale with the number of task instances in the run: while a mapped task is being scheduled the scheduler grows to several times its usual footprint, and recovers only once the run finishes.\n\n`TaskInstance.dag_run` is a joined eager load, so the run's `conf` comes back on every row a task-instance query returns, even though the ORM keeps a single `DagRun` object — and nothing in the scheduling loop reads it. Scheduling a run with 200 mapped task instances and a 0.9 MB conf peaks at 372 MiB of heap, against 3.7 MiB once the column leaves those queries, at an identical query count.\n\n## Change\n\n- `DagRun.fetch_task_instances` and the scheduler's critical-section query defer `DagRun.conf`.\n- The state re-check in `_get_ready_tis`, the mapped-dependency check and mapped expansion skip the `dag_run` join entirely.\n\nA query whose callers use the run keeps it and drops only the column; one that reads nothing but task-instance state drops the join. `conf` still loads on demand.\n\nThe callback paths keep the column: they serialize `ti.dag_run` into the execution API `DagRun` datamodel, so a batch of finishing task instances still fetches one copy each.\n\n## Behavior change\n\nReading `ti.dag_run.conf` after the loading session has closed now raises `DetachedInstanceError` instead of returning the eagerly loaded value. No caller in the tree does this.\n\ncloses: #71267\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [X] Yes — Claude Code (Opus 5)\n\nGenerated-by: Claude Code (Opus 5) following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73022/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73022/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":31116716821,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABLzuCOs8AAAAHPrNrFQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31116716821","actor":{"login":"rjgoyln","id":151457491,"node_id":"U_kgDOCQcO0w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151457491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln","html_url":"https://github.com/rjgoyln","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjgoyln/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht